const description = '看護中心與居家看護如何搭配使用？本文深入介紹高雄看護中心的服務內容、高雄居家看護的優勢，以及如何實現機構到居家的無縫照護銜接。';
const date = '2026-06-12';
const keywords = ['高雄看護中心', '高雄居家看護'];
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} type="article">
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head">
    {JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": title,
      "description": description,
      "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "宇涵居家照護站"},
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "宇涵居家照護站",
        "logo": {"@type": "ImageObject", "url": "https://yuhanhomecare.com/images/logo.png"}
